title: The Rabbit Rondo
composer: Livia Spirelli
tempo: 176
meter: 6/8
key: A
rit @196-198: 140
fermata @198.1: 2

# A jig in A major on one refrain. The form is the Fibonacci word A B A A B A B A A B A A B: 8 refrains and
# 5 episodes (both Fibonacci numbers). Episode 3 is Fibonacci's rabbits: the refrain's head in canon, the voices piling
# in faster and faster (gaps of 5, 3, 2, 1, 1 bars). The climax lifts to B major; the one soft episode is the refrain
# upside down (its mirror around B keeps the same seven notes and turns A major into F-sharp minor).
# Livia wrote it with a small generator program, which is why most parts are spelled out note by note.

